          <AccordionItem label="Begin with a walk" level={4} open><p>Choose a familiar path and look for a detail you have overlooked.</p><ul><li>Pause by the bridge.</li><li>Compare what you noticed.</li></ul></AccordionItem>
          <AccordionItem label="Bring the notes to the table" level={4}><p>Sketch one possible change together.</p><Table caption="Two useful questions" columns={[{ label: 'Question' }, { label: 'Purpose' }]} rows={[["Who uses this place?", 'Listen'], ['What could change?', 'Imagine']]} /></AccordionItem>
        </Accordion></div>
